{"id": "wm_application_listening_qa:C2-stream:r1:martial_arts:repeat_short", "condition_id": "C2-stream", "condition_name": "Human cognitive limits framing (streaming encode) (sentence-segmented)", "segment_unit": "sentence", "repeat_index": 1, "topic_id": "martial_arts", "title": "Martial Arts — Velthrak", "level": "repeat_short", "encoding_log": {"content": ["Topic: martial arts", "Velthrak is a grappling art where no striking of any kind is permitted.", "Competitors win by throwing their opponent on the ground and pinning them, and are not allowed to punch, kick, or elbow.", "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "It's the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for.", "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "Since its 1947 founding, the Dalviri Arts Council has set grades, licensed instructors, and overseen all sanctioned competition worldwide."], "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"topic\",\"value\":\"The topic is martial arts\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\", \"value\": \"The topic is martial arts\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking of any kind is permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to floor\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to floor; the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak rule\",\"value\":\"New practitioners protected from full resistance until defensive technique solid after two years\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak rule' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak origin\",\"value\":\"Originated in the Dalviri Highlands\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak governance\",\"value\":\"Governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, founded in 1947\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.delete_key:2", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:3", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak governance\", \"value\": \"Governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, founded in 1947\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak governance' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak governance\",\"value\":\"Governed by Dalviri Arts Council, founded 1947, sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees sanctioned competitions worldwide\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak governance' written."}], "final_kv": {"Velthrak": "Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to floor; the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for", "Velthrak rule": "New practitioners protected from full resistance until defensive technique solid after two years", "Velthrak origin": "Originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "Velthrak governance": "Governed by Dalviri Arts Council, founded 1947, sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees sanctioned competitions worldwide"}, "segments_log": [{"segment_index": 1, "segment_text": "Topic: martial arts", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"topic\",\"value\":\"The topic is martial arts\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\", \"value\": \"The topic is martial arts\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is martial arts"}}, {"segment_index": 2, "segment_text": "Velthrak is a grappling art where no striking of any kind is permitted.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking of any kind is permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art where no striking of any kind is permitted"}}, {"segment_index": 3, "segment_text": "Competitors win by throwing their opponent on the ground and pinning them, and are not allowed to punch, kick, or elbow.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent"}}, {"segment_index": 4, "segment_text": "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to floor\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to floor"}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "It's the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to floor; the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to floor; the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for"}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to floor; the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak rule\",\"value\":\"New practitioners protected from full resistance until defensive technique solid after two years\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak rule' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art where no striking is permitted, won by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to floor; the technique every velthrak practitioner is best known for", "Velthrak rule": "New practitioners protected from full resistance until defensive technique solid after two years"}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak origin\",\"value\":\"Originated in the Dalviri Highlands\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak governance\",\"value\":\"Governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, founded in 1947\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.delete_key:2", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_m