{"id": "wm_application_listening_qa:C2-stream:r1:martial_arts:repeat_long", "condition_id": "C2-stream", "condition_name": "Human cognitive limits framing (streaming encode) (sentence-segmented)", "segment_unit": "sentence", "repeat_index": 1, "topic_id": "martial_arts", "title": "Martial Arts — Velthrak", "level": "repeat_long", "encoding_log": {"content": ["Topic: martial arts", "Velthrak is a grappling art where no striking of any kind is permitted.", "Competitors win by throwing their opponent on the ground and pinning them, and are not allowed to punch, kick, or elbow.", "Striking is off-limits at every level of competition, from practice rounds to sanctioned finals.", "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "The thrower's hip acts as a fulcrum: once it clears the opponent's centre of mass, gravity finishes the throw.", "No other velthrak technique is as recognizable.", "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "Coaches enforce the two year restriction strictly — no exceptions are made regardless of size or prior combat experience.", "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "Since its 1947 founding, the Dalviri Arts Council has set grades, licensed instructors, and overseen all sanctioned competition worldwide.", "The Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter is the sole governing document for all certification to this day."], "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"topic\",\"value\":\"Martial arts is the subject of the recording\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where no striking of any kind is permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning opponent\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"rules\",\"value\":\"No punching, kicking, or elbowing allowed\"}", "result": "Key 'rules' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.delete_key:2", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"rules\"}", "result": "Key 'rules' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:3", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"prohibited strikes\",\"value\":\"Punching, kicking, elbowing prohibited\"}", "result": "Key 'prohibited strikes' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"prohibited strikes\",\"value\":\"Punching, kicking, elbowing prohibited at all competition levels from practice to finals\"}", "result": "Key 'prohibited strikes' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "a