ng opponent; signature move is sornek, a sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin", "prohibited strikes": "Punching, kicking, elbowing prohibited at all competition levels from practice to finals"}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts is the subject of the recording", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin", "prohibited strikes": "Punching, kicking, elbowing prohibited at all competition levels from practice to finals"}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "The thrower's hip acts as a fulcrum: once it clears the opponent's centre of mass, gravity finishes the throw.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's center of mass\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts is the subject of the recording", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's center of mass", "prohibited strikes": "Punching, kicking, elbowing prohibited at all competition levels from practice to finals"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "No other velthrak technique is as recognizable.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's center of mass; sornek is most recognizable velthrak technique\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts is the subject of the recording", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's center of mass; sornek is most recognizable velthrak technique", "prohibited strikes": "Punching, kicking, elbowing prohibited at all competition levels from practice to finals"}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"sparring restriction\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring restriction' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts is the subject of the recording", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's center of mass; sornek is most recognizable velthrak technique", "prohibited strikes": "Punching, kicking, elbowing prohibited at all competition levels from practice to finals", "sparring restriction": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience"}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"sparring restriction\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience; rule protects newer practitioners until defensive technique is solid enough\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring restriction' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts is the subject of the recording", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's center of mass; sornek is most recognizable velthrak technique", "prohibited strikes": "Punching, kicking, elbowing prohibited at all competition levels from practice to finals", "sparring restriction": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience; rule protects newer practitioners until defensive technique is solid enough"}}, {"segment_index": 11, "segment_text": "Coaches enforce the two year restriction strictly — no exceptions are made regardless of size or prior combat experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"sparring restriction\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience; coaches enforce strictly with no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring restriction' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts is the subject of the recording", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's center of mass; sornek is most recognizable velthrak technique", "prohibited strikes": "Punching, kicking, elbowing prohibited at all competition levels from practice to finals", "sparring restriction": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience; coaches enforce strictly with no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience"}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"origin\",\"value\":\"Velthrak originated in the Dalviri Highlands\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"governance\",\"value\":\"Governed by the Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.delete_key:2", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"prohibited strikes\"}", "result": "Key 'prohibited strikes' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:3", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"origin\", \"value\": \"Velthrak originated in the Dalviri Highlands\"}", "result": "Key 'origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_