rs opponent's center of mass; sornek is most recognizable velthrak technique", "origin": "Velthrak originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947, sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees sanctioned competition worldwide"}}, {"segment_index": 14, "segment_text": "The Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter is the sole governing document for all certification to this day.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"governance\",\"value\":\"Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947, sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees sanctioned competition worldwide; 1947 founding charter is sole governing document for all certification to this day\"}", "result": "Key 'governance' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts is the subject of the recording", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's center of mass; sornek is most recognizable velthrak technique", "origin": "Velthrak originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947, sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees sanctioned competition worldwide; 1947 founding charter is sole governing document for all certification to this day"}}]}, "final_kv": {"topic": "Martial arts is the subject of the recording", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking; win by throwing and pinning; sornek is signature sweeping hip throw where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's center of mass to sweep them down, finishing in floor pin; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's center of mass; sornek is most recognizable velthrak technique", "origin": "Velthrak originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "governance": "Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947, sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees sanctioned competition worldwide; 1947 founding charter is sole governing document for all certification to this day"}, "recall_raw": "", "parsed_answers": {}, "difficulty": {"passage": null, "question": null}, "parse_errors": ["passage_difficulty_missing", "question_difficulty_missing"], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "4": "Practitioners must practice for two years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [4], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA05", "question": "Which of the following are restrictions that apply in velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Striking an opponent in any form is against the rules", "2": "A person who has practiced velthrak for one year cannot engage in full-resistance sparring", "3": "The sornek may only be performed in championship-level bouts", "4": "All competition surfaces must be approved by the Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 16, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 0.64, "exact_match_correct": 0, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 0.0, "slot_utilization": 1.0}}
