s", "Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak rules": "No striking permitted, including punching, kicking, or elbowing"}}, {"segment_index": 4, "segment_text": "Striking is off-limits at every level of competition, from practice rounds to sanctioned finals.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak rules\",\"value\":\"No striking permitted at any level, from practice to finals\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak rules' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak rules": "No striking permitted at any level, from practice to finals"}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak signature\",\"value\":\"Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak signature' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak rules": "No striking permitted at any level, from practice to finals", "Velthrak signature": "Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak signature\",\"value\":\"Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, driving hip beneath opponent's centre of mass\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak signature' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak rules": "No striking permitted at any level, from practice to finals", "Velthrak signature": "Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, driving hip beneath opponent's centre of mass"}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "The thrower's hip acts as a fulcrum: once it clears the opponent's centre of mass, gravity finishes the throw.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak signature\",\"value\":\"Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, using hip as fulcrum beneath opponent's centre of mass\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak signature' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak rules": "No striking permitted at any level, from practice to finals", "Velthrak signature": "Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, using hip as fulcrum beneath opponent's centre of mass"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "No other velthrak technique is as recognizable.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak signature\",\"value\":\"Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, using hip as fulcrum beneath opponent's centre of mass, and is the most recognizable technique\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak signature' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Martial arts", "Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak rules": "No striking permitted at any level, from practice to finals", "Velthrak signature": "Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, using hip as fulcrum beneath opponent's centre of mass, and is the most recognizable technique"}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak sparring\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for those with under two years of experience\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.delete_key:1", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:2", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak sparring\", \"value\": \"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for those with under two years of experience\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak sparring' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak rules": "No striking permitted at any level, from practice to finals", "Velthrak signature": "Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, using hip as fulcrum beneath opponent's centre of mass, and is the most recognizable technique", "Velthrak sparring": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for those with under two years of experience"}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak sparring\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for those with under two years of experience, to protect newer practitioners until defensive technique is solid\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak sparring' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak rules": "No striking permitted at any level, from practice to finals", "Velthrak signature": "Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, using hip as fulcrum beneath opponent's centre of mass, and is the most recognizable technique", "Velthrak sparring": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for those with under two years of experience, to protect newer practitioners until defensive technique is solid"}}, {"segment_index": 11, "segment_text": "Coaches enforce the two year restriction strictly — no exceptions are made regardless of size or prior combat experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak sparring\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience, strictly enforced by coaches with no exceptions for size or prior combat experience\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak sparring' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak rules": "No striking permitted at any level, from practice to finals", "Velthrak signature": "Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, using hip as fulcrum beneath opponent's centre of mass, and is the most recognizable technique", "Velthrak sparring": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience, strictly enforced by coaches with no exceptions for size or prior combat experience"}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak origin\",\"value\":\"Originated in the Dalviri Highlands\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak governance\",\"value\":\"Governed by the Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947\"}", "result": "E