 competition worldwide\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak governance' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak signature": "Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, using hip as fulcrum beneath opponent's centre of mass, and is the most recognizable technique", "Velthrak origin": "Originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "Velthrak governance": "Governed by the Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947, which sets grades, licenses instructors, and oversees sanctioned competition worldwide"}}, {"segment_index": 14, "segment_text": "The Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter is the sole governing document for all certification to this day.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak governance\",\"value\":\"Governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947, whose charter remains sole governing document for all certification to this day\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak governance' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak signature": "Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, using hip as fulcrum beneath opponent's centre of mass, and is the most recognizable technique", "Velthrak origin": "Originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "Velthrak governance": "Governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947, whose charter remains sole governing document for all certification to this day"}}]}, "final_kv": {"Velthrak nature": "Grappling art where competitors win by throwing and pinning opponents", "Velthrak signature": "Sornek is a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, using hip as fulcrum beneath opponent's centre of mass, and is the most recognizable technique", "Velthrak origin": "Originated in the Dalviri Highlands", "Velthrak governance": "Governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947, whose charter remains sole governing document for all certification to this day"}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 1,2\nQuestion 2: 1,2\nQuestion 3: 1,3\nQuestion 4: 5\nQuestion 5: 5\nPassage Difficulty: 6\nQuestion Difficulty: 5", "parsed_answers": {"1": [1, 2], "2": [1, 2], "3": [1, 3], "4": [5], "5": [5]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 6, "question": 5}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "