ere no striking is permitted, competitors win by throwing and pinning, signature move is sornek (sweeping hip throw to floor pin)\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The recording is about martial arts", "Velthrak": "a grappling art where no striking is permitted, competitors win by throwing and pinning, signature move is sornek (sweeping hip throw to floor pin)"}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning, signature move sornek is sweeping hip throw to floor pin where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The recording is about martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning, signature move sornek is sweeping hip throw to floor pin where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass"}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "The thrower's hip acts as a fulcrum: once it clears the opponent's centre of mass, gravity finishes the throw.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning, signature move sornek is sweeping hip throw to floor pin where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, hip acts as fulcrum, once hip clears opponent's centre of mass gravity finishes throw\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The recording is about martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning, signature move sornek is sweeping hip throw to floor pin where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, hip acts as fulcrum, once hip clears opponent's centre of mass gravity finishes throw"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "No other velthrak technique is as recognizable.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning, signature move sornek is sweeping hip throw to floor pin where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, hip acts as fulcrum, once hip clears opponent's centre of mass gravity finishes throw, no other velthrak technique is as recognizable\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The recording is about martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning, signature move sornek is sweeping hip throw to floor pin where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, hip acts as fulcrum, once hip clears opponent's centre of mass gravity finishes throw, no other velthrak technique is as recognizable"}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak rules\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak rules' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The recording is about martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning, signature move sornek is sweeping hip throw to floor pin where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, hip acts as fulcrum, once hip clears opponent's centre of mass gravity finishes throw, no other velthrak technique is as recognizable", "Velthrak rules": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience"}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak rules\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience, protects newer practitioners until defensive technique is solid\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak rules' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The recording is about martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning, signature move sornek is sweeping hip throw to floor pin where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, hip acts as fulcrum, once hip clears opponent's centre of mass gravity finishes throw, no other velthrak technique is as recognizable", "Velthrak rules": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience, protects newer practitioners until defensive technique is solid"}}, {"segment_index": 11, "segment_text": "Coaches enforce the two year restriction strictly — no exceptions are made regardless of size or prior combat experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak rules\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience, no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak rules' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "The recording is about martial arts", "Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning, signature move sornek is sweeping hip throw to floor pin where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, hip acts as fulcrum, once hip clears opponent's centre of mass gravity finishes throw, no other velthrak technique is as recognizable", "Velthrak rules": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience, no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience"}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak origin\",\"value\":\"Originated in Dalviri Highlands\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak governance\",\"value\":\"Governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.delete_key:2", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"topic\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:3", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak governance\", \"value\": \"Governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak governance' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning, signature move sornek is sweeping hip throw to floor pin where thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, hip acts as fulcrum, once hip clears opponent's centre of mass gravity finishes throw, no other velthrak technique is as recognizable", "Velthrak rules": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience, no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience", "Velthrak origin": "Originated in Dalviri Highlands", "Velthrak governance": "Governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947"}}, {"segment_index": 13, "segment_text": "Since its 1947 founding, the Dalviri Arts Council has set grades, licensed instructors, and overseen all sanctioned competition worldwide.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak governance\",\"value\":\"Governed by Dalviri Arts Council found