h no striking, win by throwing and pinning; signature move is sornek sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak sparring rule\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for those with under two years of experience\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak sparring rule' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak sparring rule\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for those with under two years of experience; protects newer practitioners until defensive technique is solid\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak sparring rule' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak sparring rule\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience; coaches enforce strictly with no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak sparring rule' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak origin\",\"value\":\"Originated in Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak origin\",\"value\":\"Originated in Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947, which sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees sanctioned competition worldwide\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak origin\",\"value\":\"Originated in Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947 with charter as sole governing document for all certification to this day\"}", "result": "Key '