neath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down"}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "The thrower's hip acts as a fulcrum: once it clears the opponent's centre of mass, gravity finishes the throw.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning; signature move is sornek sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's centre of mass\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning; signature move is sornek sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin; thrower drives hip beneath opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down; hip acts as fulcrum, gravity finishes throw once hip clears opponent's centre of mass"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "No other velthrak technique is as recognizable.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning; signature move is sornek sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning; signature move is sornek sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak sparring rule\",\"value\":\"Full-resistance sparring prohibited for those with under two year