rring rule": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience; coaches enforce strictly with no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience"}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak origin\",\"value\":\"Originated in Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak origin' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning; signature move is sornek sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin", "Velthrak sparring rule": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience; coaches enforce strictly with no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience", "Velthrak origin": "Originated in Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947"}}, {"segment_index": 13, "segment_text": "Since its 1947 founding, the Dalviri Arts Council has set grades, licensed instructors, and overseen all sanctioned competition worldwide.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak origin\",\"value\":\"Originated in Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947, which sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees sanctioned competition worldwide\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak origin' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning; signature move is sornek sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin", "Velthrak sparring rule": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience; coaches enforce strictly with no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience", "Velthrak origin": "Originated in Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947, which sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees sanctioned competition worldwide"}}, {"segment_index": 14, "segment_text": "The Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter is the sole governing document for all certification to this day.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"Velthrak origin\",\"value\":\"Originated in Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947 with charter as sole governing document for all certification to this day\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak origin' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "Topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning; signature move is sornek sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin", "Velthrak sparring rule": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience; coaches enforce strictly with no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience", "Velthrak origin": "Originated in Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947 with charter as sole governing document for all certification to this day"}}]}, "final_kv": {"topic": "Topic is martial arts", "Velthrak": "Grappling art with no striking, win by throwing and pinning; signature move is sornek sweeping hip throw finishing in floor pin", "Velthrak sparring rule": "Full-resistance sparring prohibited for under two years experience; coaches enforce strictly with no exceptions regardless of size or prior combat experience", "Velthrak origin": "Originated in Dalviri Highlands, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded in 1947 with charter as sole governing document for all certification to this day"}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 1,2\nQuestion 2: 1,2\nQuestion 3: 1,3\nQuestion 4: 4\nQuestion 5: 1,2\n\nPassage Difficulty: 5\nQuestion Difficulty: 6", "parsed_answers": {"1": [1, 2], "2": [1, 2], "3": [1, 3], "4": [4], "5": [1, 2]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 5, "question": 6}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "4": "Practitioners must practice for two years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [4], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA05", "question": "Which of the following are restrictions that apply in velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Striking an opponent in any form is against the rules", "2": "A person who has practiced velthrak for one year cannot engage in full-resistance sparring", "3": "The sornek may only be performed in championship-level bouts", "4": "All competition surfaces must be approved by the Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 25, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 1.0, "exact_match_correct": 5, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 1.0, "slot_utilization": 1.0}}
{"id": "wm_application_listening_qa:C2-stream:r1:martial_arts:distractor", "condition_id": "C2-stream", "condition_name": "Human cognitive limits framing (streaming encode) (sentence-segmented)", "segment_unit": "sentence", "repeat_index": 1, "topic_id": "martial_arts", "title": "Martial Arts — Velthrak", "level": "distractor", "encoding_log": {"content": ["Topic: martial arts", "Velthrak is a grappling art where striking of any kind is not permitted.", "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "A related striking art from a neighboring region is kestro, built around punches, kicks, and elbow strikes rather than throws.", "Bouts are scored on a ten-point system: a clean strike to the torso earns two points, a strike to the head earns three, and a knockdown scores a full five, with judges deducting a point for any strike below the waist.", "Fighters are classified into five weight tiers, and each tier has its own minimum number of sanctioned bouts required before a fighter can be ranked nationally.", "Matches run three rounds of two minutes each, separated by a mandatory ninety-second rest interval.", "Judges score each bout independently and submit tallies to a central scoring table, where a majority-decision rule resolves any split verdict among the three officials."], "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"topic\",\"value\":\"Topic is martial arts\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"velthrak\",\"value\":\"Grappling art where striking of any kind is not permitted\"}", "result": "Key 'velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "n