 where striking is not permitted, signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin"}}, {"segment_index": 4, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"velthrak\",\"value\":\"a grappling art where striking is not permitted, signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, full-resistance sparring forbidden for under two years experience\"}", "result": "Key 'velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "topic details will follow when next segment arrives", "velthrak": "a grappling art where striking is not permitted, signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin, full-resistance sparring forbidden for under two years experience"}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"velthrak\",\"value\":\"grappling art from Dalviri Highlands, no striking, signature move is sornek (sweeping hip throw to floor pin), full-resistance sparring forbidden under two years experience, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947\"}", "result": "Key 'velthrak' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "topic details will follow when next segment arrives", "velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands, no striking, signature move is sornek (sweeping hip throw to floor pin), full-resistance sparring forbidden under two years experience, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947"}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "A related striking art from a neighboring region is kestro, built around punches, kicks, and elbow strikes rather than throws.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"kestro\",\"value\":\"striking art from neighboring region, uses punches, kicks, elbow strikes, no throws\"}", "result": "Key 'kestro' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "topic details will follow when next segment arrives", "velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands, no striking, signature move is sornek (sweeping hip throw to floor pin), full-resistance sparring forbidden under two years experience, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region, uses punches, kicks, elbow strikes, no throws"}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "Bouts are scored on a ten-point system: a clean strike to the torso earns two points, a strike to the head earns three, and a knockdown scores a full five, with judges deducting a point for any strike below the waist.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"kestro\",\"value\":\"striking art from neighboring region, uses punches, kicks, elbow strikes, no throws, ten-point scoring: torso strikes = 2pts, head strikes = 3pts, knockdowns = 5pts, penalties for low strikes\"}", "result": "Key 'kestro' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "topic details will follow when next segment arrives", "velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands, no striking, signature move is sornek (sweeping hip throw to floor pin), full-resistance sparring forbidden under two years experience, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region, uses punches, kicks, elbow strikes, no throws, ten-point scoring: torso strikes = 2pts, head strikes = 3pts, knockdowns = 5pts, penalties for low strikes"}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "Fighters are classified into five weight tiers, and each tier has its own minimum number of sanctioned bouts required before a fighter can be ranked nationally.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"weight_tiers\",\"value\":\"five weight tiers, each with minimum sanctioned bouts required before national ranking\"}", "result": "Key 'weight_tiers' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"topic": "topic details will follow when next segment arrives", "velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands, no striking, signature move is sornek (sweeping hip throw to floor pin), full-resistance sparring forbidden under two years experience, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region, uses punches, kicks, elbow strikes, no throws, ten-point scoring: torso strikes = 2pts, head strikes = 3pts, knockdowns = 5pts, penalties for low strikes", "weight_tiers": "five weight tiers, each with minimum sanctioned bouts required before national ranking"}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Matches run three rounds of two minutes each, separated by a mandatory ninety-second rest interval.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"match_format\",\"value\":\"Three rounds of two minutes each with ninety-second rest intervals\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"topic\",\"value\":\"Matches run three rounds of two minutes with ninety-second rest intervals\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.delete_key:2", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"topic\"}", "result": "Key 'topic' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:3", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"match_format\",\"value\":\"Matches run three rounds of two minutes with ninety-second rest intervals\"}", "result": "Key 'match_format' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands, no striking, signature move is sornek (sweeping hip throw to floor pin), full-resistance sparring forbidden under two years experience, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region, uses punches, kicks, elbow strikes, no throws, ten-point scoring: torso strikes = 2pts, head strikes = 3pts, knockdowns = 5pts, penalties for low strikes", "weight_tiers": "five weight tiers, each with minimum sanctioned bouts required before national ranking", "match_format": "Matches run three rounds of two minutes with ninety-second rest intervals"}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "Judges score each bout independently and submit tallies to a central scoring table, where a majority-decision rule resolves any split verdict among the three officials.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\":\"scoring_process\",\"value\":\"Judges score independently, submit tallies to central table, majority-decision rule resolves split verdicts among three officials\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.delete_key:1", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"weight_tiers\"}", "result": "Key 'weight_tiers' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "functions.write_memory:2", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"scoring_process\", \"value\": \"Judges score independently, submit tallies to central table, majority-decision rule resolves split verdicts among three officials\"}", "result": "Key 'scoring_process' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands, no striking, signature move is sornek (sweeping hip throw to floor pin), full-resistance sparring forbidden under two years experience, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region, uses punches, kicks, elbow strikes, no throws, ten-point scoring: torso strikes = 2pts, head strikes = 3pts, knockdowns = 5pts, penalties for low strikes", "match_format": "Matches run three rounds of two minutes with ninety-second rest intervals", "scoring_process": "Judges score independently, submit tallies to central table, majority-decision rule resolves split verdicts among three officials"}}]}, "final_kv": {"velthrak": "grappling art from Dalviri Highlands, no striking, signature move is sornek (sweeping hip throw to floor pin), full-resistance sparring forbidden under two years experience, governed by Dalviri Arts Council founded 1947", "kestro": "striking art from neighboring region, uses punches, kicks, elbow strikes, no throws, ten-point scoring: torso strikes = 2pts, head strikes = 3pts, knockdowns = 5pts, penalties for low strikes", "match_format": "Matches run three rounds of two minutes with ninety-second rest intervals", "scoring_process": "Judges score independently, submit tallies to central table, majority-decision rule resolves split verdicts among three officials"}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 1,2\nQuestion 2: 1,2\nQuestion 3: 1,3\nQuestion 4: 4\nQuestion 5: 1,2\nPassage Difficulty: 6\nQuestion Difficulty: 5", "parsed_answers": {"1": [1, 2], "2": [1, 2], "3": [1, 3], "4": [4], "5": [1, 2]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 6, "question": 5}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "4": "Practitioners must practice for two years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [4], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA05", "question": "Which of the following are restrictions that apply in velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Striking an opponent in any form is against the rules", "2": "A person who has practiced velthrak for one year cannot engage in full-resistance sparring", "3": "The sornek may only be performed in championship-level bouts", "4": "All competition surfaces must be approved by the Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 25, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 1.0, "exact_match_correct": 5, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 1.0, "slot_utilization": 1.0}}
